#: website/public/showcase/index.html:213
msgctxt "page:showcase/index.html"
msgid ""
"Find Aegis's six-digit code calculation in its released APK. Trace the "
"generating methods with REA, then move a demo clock to see why the code "
"changes every 30 seconds."
msgstr ""
"محاسبه کد شش رقمی Aegis را در APK منتشر شده خود پیدا کنید . روش های تولید را"
